           If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                    03260038
               Move  'C101'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        03270038
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03280038
           End-If                                                       03290038
      *                                                                 03300038
           Move  W-1ste-Paaske-Dag       To    W-Current-Dato           03310038
           Perform D000-Dag-Nr-Fra-Start                                03320038
