               Move  'C102'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        03340038
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03350038
           End-If                                                       03360038
      *                                                                 03370038
           Divide W-Curr-Dag-Nr                                         03380038
               By        7                                              03390038
               Giving    W-Integer                                      03400038
               Remainder W-Start-Dag                                    03410038
      *                                                                 03420038
           If  W-Start-Dag               <     +1                       03430038
               Add   +7                  To    W-Start-Dag              03440038
           End-If                                                       03450038
      *                                                                 03460038
           Compute  W-Start-Dag                                         03470038
               =    ( W-Start-Dag - 8)                                  03480038
               *    -1                                                  03490038
      *                                                                 03500038
           .                                                            03510038
       C199-Exit.                                                       03520038
           Exit.                                                        03530038
