      *################################################################*04570038
       C400-Forrige-Bankdag              Section.                       04580038
      *                                                                 04590038
      * Finner forrige bank-dag.                                        04600038
      *                                                                 04610038
           Move  R7919090-In-Dato        In    R7919090-Helligdager     04620038
                                         To    W-Current-Dato           04630038
      *                                                                 04640038
           Perform With Test After                                      04650038
                   Until SW-Bank-Dag                                    04660038
      *                                                                 04670038
               Initialize                      R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager04680038
               Set   R7919010-Versjon    To    True                     04690038
               Move  W-Current-Dato      To    R7919010-In-Dato         04700038
               Move  -1                  To    R7919010-In-Adder-Dag    04710038
               Perform F7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager                        04720038
               If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                 04730038
                   Move  'C401'          To    R7919999-Paragraf        04740038
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   04750038
               End-If                                                   04760038
      *                                                                 04770038
               Move  R7919010-Ut-Dato    To    W-Current-Dato           04780038
      *                                                                 04790038
               Perform D000-Dag-Nr-Fra-Start                            04800038
               If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                04810038
                   Move  'C402'          To    R7919999-Paragraf        04820038
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   04830038
               End-If                                                   04840038
      *                                                                 04850038
               Perform E000-Ukedag                                      04860038
               If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                04870038
                   Move  'C403'          To    R7919999-Paragraf        04880038
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   04890038
               End-If                                                   04900038
      *                                                                 04910038
               Perform F000-Fridager                                    04920038
               If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                04930038
                   Move  'C404'          To    R7919999-Paragraf        04940038
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   04950038
               End-If                                                   04960038
      *                                                                 04970038
               Perform G000-Bank-Dag                                    04980038
               If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                04990038
                   Move  'C405'          To    R7919999-Paragraf        05000038
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   05010038
               End-If                                                   05020038
      *                                                                 05030038
           End-Perform                                                  05040038
      *                                                                 05050038
           Compute  R7919090-Ut-Dgr-Forr-Bankdag                        05060038
                                         In    R7919090-Helligdager     05070038
               =    W-Orig-Dag-Nr                                       05080038
               -    W-Curr-Dag-Nr                                       05090038
      *                                                                 05100038
           .                                                            05110038
       C499-Exit.                                                       05120038
           Exit.                                                        05130038
      *################################################################*05140038
