      *################################################################*05500038
       E000-Ukedag                       Section.                       05510038
      *                                                                 05520038
           Divide W-Curr-Dag-Nr                                         05530038
               By        7                                              05540038
               Giving    W-Integer                                      05550038
               Remainder W-Ukedag                                       05560038
      *                                                                 05570038
           Compute  W-Ukedag                                            05580038
               =    W-Ukedag                                            05590038
               +    W-Start-Dag - 1                                     05600038
      *                                                                 05610038
           If  W-Ukedag                  <     +1                       05620038
               Add   +7                  To    W-Ukedag                 05630038
           End-If                                                       05640038
           If  W-Ukedag                  >     +7                       05650038
               Subtract +7               From  W-Ukedag                 05660038
           End-If                                                       05670038
      *                                                                 05680038
           .                                                            05690038
       E099-Exit.                                                       05700038
           Exit.                                                        05710038
      *################################################################*05720038
       F000-Fridager                     Section.                       05730038
      *                                                                 05740038
           Set   SW-Ikke-Fridag          To    True                     05750038
           Move  Space                   To    W-Dag-Type               05760038
           Move  +0                      To    Ind-Spes                 05770038
      *                                                                 05780038
           Perform F100-Faste-Fridager                                  05790038
           If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                    05800038
               Move  'F001'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        05810038
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05820038
           End-If                                                       05830038
      *                                                                 05840038
