           Set   Sw-Spes-Langfredag (Ind-Spes)                          07140038
                                         To    True                     07150038
      *                                                                 07160038
           Add   +1                      To    Ind-Spes                 07170038
           Initialize                          R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager07180038
           Set   R7919010-Versjon        To    True                     07190038
           Move  W-1ste-Paaske-Dag       To    R7919010-In-Dato         07200038
           Move  W-Diff-Paaskeaften      To    R7919010-In-Adder-Dag    07210038
           Perform F7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager                            07220038
           If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                     07230038
               Move  'F204'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        07240038
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07250038
           End-If                                                       07260038
           Move  R7919010-Ut-Dato        To    W-Spes-Dato (Ind-Spes)   07270038
           Set   Sw-Spes-Paaskeaften (Ind-Spes)                         07280038
                                         To    True                     07290038
      *                                                                 07300038
           Add   +1                      To    Ind-Spes                 07310038
