           Set   R7919010-Versjon        To    True                     07330038
           Move  W-1ste-Paaske-Dag       To    R7919010-In-Dato         07340038
           Move  W-Diff-2ndre-Paaske-Dag To    R7919010-In-Adder-Dag    07350038
           Perform F7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager                            07360038
           If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                     07370038
               Move  'F205'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        07380038
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07390038
           End-If                                                       07400038
           Move  R7919010-Ut-Dato        To    W-Spes-Dato (Ind-Spes)   07410038
           Set   Sw-Spes-2-Paaskedag (Ind-Spes)                         07420038
                                         To    True                     07430038
      *                                                                 07440038
           Add   +1                      To    Ind-Spes                 07450038
           Initialize                          R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager07460038
           Set   R7919010-Versjon        To    True                     07470038
           Move  W-1ste-Paaske-Dag       To    R7919010-In-Dato         07480038
           Move  W-Diff-Kristi-Himmelfart                               07490038
                                         To    R7919010-In-Adder-Dag    07500038
           Perform F7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager                            07510038
           If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                     07520038
